title: [+ z_party_name +] Media
new-page: true

# Ripped from c2508's amazing Christian Democracy mod

@media
title: Media
view-if: {!
    if (Q.z_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.labor_minister_party == Q.z_party_name && Q.labor_affairs_post_timer > 0 && Q.strike_term_seen_post_timer != 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_enemies_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_media_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] wields much influence in the Germany media, with control over many local and regional newspapers throughout every German city and region.

- @campaign
- @ideological
- @newspaper 
- @newspaper_2
- @newspaper_3
- @newspaper_4

@campaign
title: The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] will use their media to elect more <span style="color: #000000;">Catholics</span>.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.z_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper == 0 && Q.z_resources >= 3) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper > 0 && Q.z_newspaper <= 2 && Q.z_resources >= 2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper > 2 && Q.z_newspaper <= 5 && Q.z_resources >= 2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper > 5 && Q.catholics_z < 50) {
        return true;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper > 5) {
        return false;
    } else {
        return true;
    }
!}

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s campaign media is mostly reaching the <span style="color: #000000;">Catholics</span> who already vote for them.

@ideological
title: The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] will continue to follow the official party line regarding important issues. 
view-if: {!
    if (Q.z_dissent > 0.2) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

This has been their media course historically, and it has successfully paved over the many tensions in the party.

@newspaper
title: Allocate funds to Germania
subtitle: -3 resource
view-if: {!
    if (Q.z_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.z_newspaper == 0 && Q.z_resources >= 3) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span> ?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]'s funding has enabled their newspaper to begin distribution in towns and regions it has been previously absent. 

